    "body": "```suggestion\r\nexport STARSHIP_SESSION_KEY=(random 10000000000000 9999999999999999)\r\n```\r\n\r\nLet's go one step further. Since it's not meant to be secure, use a 16-digit number, and we're done.\r\nI first copy/paste-and-adapt the code from Bash, but fish can do better, so let's do it. And it's lot easier to read.",
    "created_at": "2020-11-21T20:38:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-11-21T20:38:28Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/1904#discussion_r528240188",
