    "body": "Is that going to work on <64 Bit systems? \r\n\r\nNew benchmarks:\r\n| Command | Mean [ms] | Min [ms] | Max [ms] | Relative |\r\n|:---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\r\n| `fish -c 'export X=(starship session)'` | 17.4 ± 9.2 | 5.6 | 33.9 | 1.00 |\r\n| `fish -c 'export X=(random 10000000000000 9999999999999999)'` | 18.4 ± 6.9 | 3.9 | 30.1 | 1.06 ± 0.68 |\r\n\r\n| Command | Mean [ms] | Min [ms] | Max [ms] | Relative |\r\n|:---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\r\n| `fish -c 'export X=(starship session)'` | 6.5 ± 0.4 | 5.9 | 9.4 | 1.35 ± 0.15 |\r\n| `fish -c 'export X=(random 10000000000000 9999999999999999)'` | 4.8 ± 0.4 | 4.1 | 5.9 | 1.00 |",
