    "body": "Yes it should. Fish [parses arguments as `long long`](https://github.com/fish-shell/fish-shell/blob/master/src/builtin_random.cpp#L63), and standard C++ says that it is [at least 64 bits](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/types#Properties)",
